    <string name="predicted_race_performance">Predicted Race Performance</string>
    <string name="predicted_race_performance_text1">While other race time predictor equations exist, this app uses the equation published by Peter Riegel (1981).\n\n</string>
    <string name="predicted_race_performance_text2">It takes the time and distance entered by you in the app, and uses an exponent (^1.06) to represent the changes in fatigue and pace that occur in longer (or shorter) distances, making it useful for estimating your performance in a different race distance than one you\'ve already completed.\n\n</string>
